      <div style="font:500 12px var(--font-mono);color:var(--color-forest);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:18px">/ Questions we get</div>
      <h2 style="font:600 var(--type-display-2)/1.08 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 40px;color:var(--color-forest);text-wrap:pretty">Questions we get</h2>
      
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:28px 40px">
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Do you hold security clearances?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Some of our team hold clearances in specific jurisdictions. Tell us what your contract requires and we will confirm whether we can staff it.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Can you work within our data residency requirements?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">Yes. Testing can be conducted from within a specified jurisdiction and all engagement data held accordingly. This is agreed before the engagement starts.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Will your report satisfy our accrediting body?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">It provides testing evidence mapped to the control framework your contract names. The accreditation decision remains with your assessor or authorizing official.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--border-default);padding-top:16px">
          <h3 style="font:600 16px/1.3 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 6px;color:var(--color-ink)">Do you subcontract?</h3>
          <p style="font:400 13.5px/1.55 var(--font-body);color:var(--text-secondary);margin:0;text-wrap:pretty">No. Every engagement is delivered by our own team, which matters when your contract has flow-down security requirements.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
